BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 778.00 Td (BENEFITS) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 758.10 Td (Simplifies application logic.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 738.20 Td (Low-latency data access for cache hits.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 718.30 Td (TRADE-OFFS) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 698.40 Td (Higher latency during initial reads due to the mandatory DB query.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 678.50 Td (BEST FOR:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 658.60 Td (Read-heavy apps like CDNs or social media feeds.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 58.00 625.70 Td (Cache Aside \(Lazy Loading\)) Tj ET
