BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 174.90 Td (THE FLOW) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 155.00 Td (Application checks the cache first.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 135.10 Td (On a miss, the app retrieves from DB and manually loads it into the cache.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 115.20 Td (LOGIC & OWNERSHIP) Tj ET
