BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 486.85 Td (the write process.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 466.95 Td (BENEFITS) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 447.05 Td (Significantly reduces write latency.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 427.15 Td (High performance for frequent or batched write operations.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 407.25 Td (TRADE-OFFS) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 387.35 Td (Risk of data loss if the cache fails before the data syncs to the DB.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 367.45 Td (BEST FOR:) Tj ET
