BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 331.95 Td (Financial banking Banking Applications.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 312.05 Td (These applications need strong consitency.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 292.15 Td (AP based Applications) Tj ET
