BT /F2 12 Tf 58.00 765.00 Td (Reverse Proxy \(Server-Side Proxy\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 744.40 Td (A Reverse Proxy \(Server-Side Proxy / internal-facing proxy\) sits between the internet and the web servers \(the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 731.00 Td (destination\). When a user makes a request to a website, the request hits the Reverse Proxy first. The proxy then) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 717.60 Td (decides which backend server should handle the request. Once the server finishes the job, it sends the data) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 704.20 Td (back to the proxy, which then passes it back to the user.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 684.30 Td (While a forward proxy acts as a middleman for the client, a reverse proxy acts as a middleman for the server. It) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 670.90 Td (hides the servers\222 real identity and protects them from the internet. It abstracts away the complexity of the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 657.50 Td (downstream systems.) Tj ET
q 479.00 0 0 368.83 58.00 263.77 cm /Im40 Do Q
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 254.77 Td (Advantages of Reverse Proxy) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 234.87 Td (Load Balancing: Reverse proxies act as traffic controllers. They distribute incoming requests across multiple) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 221.47 Td (servers so that no single server gets overwhelmed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 201.57 Td (Server Protection & Security: The proxy acts as a shield. It hides the real IP addresses of the backend servers,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 188.17 Td (making it impossible for hackers to target them directly. It can also block DDoS attacks or suspicious traffic) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 174.77 Td (before it even reaches the actual data.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 154.87 Td (SSL Termination: Handling the HTTPS lock icon \(encryption\) is heavy work for a server. The reverse proxy) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 141.47 Td (handles all the encryption and decryption, freeing up the backend servers to focus strictly on its tasks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 121.57 Td (Caching: Reverse proxies can cache frequently requested resources, reducing the need for repeated requests to) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 108.17 Td (the web servers.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 88.27 Td (Response Modification & Compression: The proxy can shrink files \(compression\) to make them load faster on) Tj ET
