BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 778.00 Td (This works perfectly\205 at small scale.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 758.10 Td (Now as the app grows, suddenly this endpoint becomes one of our hottest paths because this traditional) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 744.70 Td (approach does a full db scan which takes O\(n\) which is good if the number of rows in our table is limited to some) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 731.30 Td (extent, but at millions and billions of records, the same query will take forever to return the result. \(not only) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 717.90 Td (because we have multiple rows to check, but also that during registration people will retry multiple usernames,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 704.50 Td (this in-turn increases the QPS, which can still hammer our DB, and increase the response latency,\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 684.60 Td (And introducing a cache doesnt make sense here as we are trying to see if a username exists or not. \(cache) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 671.20 Td (stores the frequently accessed data, which is irrelevant to us\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 651.30 Td (So at this scale now we have to protect the db from being overwhelmed,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 631.40 Td (So our next approach would be to store the existing usernames in a set, and each time someone requests for a) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 618.00 Td (username check, instead of hitting the db, we will first check if the username is present in the set or no.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 598.10 Td (Thanks for reading Evolving Engineer! Subscribe for free to receive new posts and support my work.) Tj ET
q 479.00 0 0 276.76 58.00 296.44 cm /Im43 Do Q
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 287.44 Td (A Set lookup is super fast as it gives a O\(1\) look up time, but when our app grows to Instagram scale, storing) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 274.04 Td (billions of strings in a traditional in-memory Set will destroy our RAM, and also is super expensive. \(1 billion) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 260.64 Td (usernames, each with average of 10 characters, roughly above 10GB + just for names ?\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 240.74 Td (Here is where Bloom Filters come in to the rescue, and solves the above problem optimally.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 58.00 207.84 Td (What is Bloom Filter ?) Tj ET
