BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 143.51 Td (hash\(username\) % 128) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 123.61 Td (Set the corresponding bit \(hash\(username\) % 128\) to 1 in the array. If a bit is already 1, we just leave it as 1.) Tj ET
