BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 195.14 Td (with billions of row.\224 That\222s exactly how even Kafka works.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 175.24 Td (Just like how a database shards data when a single node becomes a write bottleneck, Exactly how even kafka) Tj ET
